@a

--- label-unattached-warn (skip: heading numbering property not modeled) ---
#set heading(numbering: "1.")
// Warning: 1-4 label `<a>` is not attached to anything
<a>

--- label-non-existent-error ---
// Error: 5-10 content does not have field "label"
#[].label

--- label-empty ---
// Error: 29-31 label name must not be empty
= Something to label #label("")
